<title>ITALY: Gross yield falls at Italian 10-YR BTP auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yield falls at Italian 10-YR BTP auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a third tranche of 2.0 trillion lire of 10-year Italian Treasury fixed rate bonds (BTP) carrying a 6.75 percent coupon.</p>
<p>		   February 1, 2007   previous</p>
<p> Net Yield	 6.17 pct vs	6.20 pct</p>
<p> Gross Yield     7.06 pct vs	7.09 pct</p>
<p> Assigned price  98.60    vs     98.40</p>
<p> Bids		 2.985 trillion lire</p>
<p> Assigned	   2.000 trillion lire</p>
<p>Note - Comparison is with the previous auction of the first tranche of the 10-year Btp at the end of January.</p>
</text>
